 "doc": "//! 🥣️ Companion tests of the workflow run artifact: package contract, admission and replay laws, the mutation descriptor roster and the SQLite snapshot laws.\n//!\n//! 🧭️ Every law reads the artifact through its public vocabulary and reads its fixtures from the artifact directory at run time.",
